# made of c43ac33704f07ad1
# `points[0].x`: nobody asks whether the receiver is a cell where the target lets the read of the word of its shape answer: what is no cell is no address, the read faults and is given zero, the word of a cell without a shape.
# A fault costs microseconds. So only in front of an access through the value, which throws off undefined and null, and only where no number and no boolean is expected of it: `expectsCell`.
# f1 = oneField, f2 = twoFields, f3 = nothingOrMoney, f4 = numberOrMoney, f5 = booleanOrMoney, f6 = numberIsToldApart, f7 = truthOf
